cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use data-eng-bench in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "data-eng-bench: a data-engineering benchmark for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  103 realistic dbt data-engineering tasks (analytics models, dimensional
  modeling, incremental models, and bug-fixes) for evaluating AI coding agents,
  runnable hermetically on DuckDB or against Snowflake.
authors:
  - name: "Snowflake Inc."
repository-code: "https://github.com/Snowflake-Labs/data-eng-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-29"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - coding-agents
  - dbt
  - data-engineering
  - snowflake
  - duckdb
